=== owned real field: division and reciprocal agree
RR(1)/RR(2) -> 1/2
RR(3)/RR(2) -> 3/2
RR(3)/ZZ(3) -> 1
~RR(2) -> 1/2
RR(2).inverse_of_unit() -> 1/2
RR(2) * ~RR(2) -> 1
~RR(0) !! ZeroDivisionError: cannot divide 1 by 0: the denominator is zero
RR(1)/RR(0) !! ZeroDivisionError: cannot divide 1 by 0: the denominator is zero
RR(1).divide_by_unit(RR(2)) -> 1/2
=== owned complex field: the same two statements
CC(1)/CC(2) -> 1/2
~CC(2) -> 1/2
CC(2) * ~CC(2) -> 1
=== module elements over QQ and over ZZ
QQ-module v / 2 -> (1)/(2)*e_0
QQ-module v / QQ(1/2) !! TypeError: cannot convert non-integral float to integer
QQ-module v / ZZ(3) -> (1)/(3)*e_0
ZZ-module v / ZZ(2) (not a unit: refused) !! ZeroDivisionError: 2 is not a unit
=== the lattice invariant that opened the cause
square.packing_radius() -> 1/2
square.center_density() -> 1/4
